# The code owners of this repository: GitHub asks the owner named on a path to review every
# pull request that changes a file under it. The paths below steer how the repository is
# built, checked and worked on: its workflows, the instructions and commands for Claude
# Code, its manifest and the answers it was generated from. sdk-template renders the file
# from its `human` answer, and `copier update` renders it again, so a change goes to the
# answer or to the template, never to this copy.
/.github/** @{{ human }}
/CLAUDE.md @{{ human }}
/.claude/** @{{ human }}
/rules/** @{{ human }}
/pyproject.toml @{{ human }}
/.copier-answers.yml @{{ human }}
